    {
      "index": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "moduleId": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "caption",
          "text": "A few animations I made for the game using Adobe Photoshop. Since I was in charge of map design, I also decided on our colour theme.",
          "links": []
        }
      ],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "type": "text",
      "moduleId": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "I personally specialise in non-human sprite creation and animation. In other words, I worked a lot with drawing and animating everything but the human sprites (maps, tiles, objects, etc). I also developed a centralized managing system for our artists to share assets (which involved Trello, Dropbox, and Github).",
          "links": []
        }
      ],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "type": "image",
      "moduleId": null,
      "image": {
        "role": "content",
        "sourceUrl": "https://cdn.myportfolio.com/c7e93eda-a4d0-46e4-920f-c5a1915a4d2c/f86522ba-696f-40d3-84a6-d439661b73e6.jpg?h=d25acc8d0b009b9c5cfa6d3017ea3bb0",
        "variant": "lightbox-original",
        "declaredWidth": null,
        "crop": null,
        "assetId": "f86522ba-696f-40d3-84a6-d439661b73e6",
        "ext": "jpg",
        "alt": "",
        "width": 1920,
        "height": null,
        "caption": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "type": "text",
      "moduleId": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "caption",
          "text": "To make a map, you need to use tiles, which are repetitive assets we assembled in Tiled Map Editor. For this game, I made over 70 tiles and objects.",
          "links": []
        }
      ],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "type": "text",
      "moduleId": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "In both April and August, we demo’ed this game to incoming first-years, hoping to attract students interested in indie games and wanting to learn more about game development. We got over 90 sign-ups — affirming my original instinct that there is a robust game-loving community at Yale!",
          "links": []
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "In the meantime, we also worked on establishing ourselves as a campus presence. After working out the bureaucratic and financial logistics of being an officially registered club at Yale, we worked on rebranding ourselves.",
          "links": []
        }
      ],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "type": "media_collection",
      "moduleId": "m67d798caaf07e370ea7c55e1efbe0e626a99f825e600b66dbadd0",
      "images": [
