    {
      "index": 17,
      "type": "text",
      "moduleId": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "caption",
          "text": "I made this logo partially so I could practice using the pen tool on Illustrator.",
          "links": []
        }
      ],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "type": "text",
      "moduleId": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Originally, we called ourselves YGames. After the semester, we decided to rename ourselves to Amoriem Labs, after our first game, and went through a couple iterations of a logo design. One of our first-years designed the logo below on the right for us:",
          "links": []
        }
      ],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "type": "media_collection",
      "moduleId": "m67d798f0a08b3a353f3fb20ff69af2cc4d4df9be3d3dbf6bab2e6",
      "images": [
        {
          "role": "content",
          "sourceUrl": "https://cdn.myportfolio.com/c7e93eda-a4d0-46e4-920f-c5a1915a4d2c/6b4be381-603b-44e3-9c93-6b2d7fb42237_rw_1200.jpg?h=d064cdbbcfe956242bc54d4a314a412b",
          "variant": "largest-srcset",
          "declaredWidth": 1038,
          "crop": null,
          "assetId": null,
          "ext": null,
          "alt": "",
          "width": 1038,
          "height": 1000,
          "caption": null
        },
        {
          "role": "content",
          "sourceUrl": "https://cdn.myportfolio.com/c7e93eda-a4d0-46e4-920f-c5a1915a4d2c/e28efcee-2cfa-4e96-9409-4ecb4fb6cc89_rw_600.jpg?h=4a13cd603523fb91e66bd0a441427074",
          "variant": "largest-srcset",
          "declaredWidth": 500,
          "crop": null,
          "assetId": null,
          "ext": null,
          "alt": "",
          "width": 500,
          "height": 500,
          "caption": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "type": "text",
      "moduleId": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "We were very nearly named \"Donut Hole Studios,\" after the fact that I brought donut holes to every work session as a snack. I designed the logo on the left. One of our first-years submitted the logo on the right, which vertically looks like a skull with a heart (playing on the word Amoriem), and horizontally looks like the buttons on a console controller. Super cool!",
          "links": []
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Today, we are working on a retro fighting game (think Streetfighter) called Bulldog Bash. The main characters are prominent Yale administrators and our mascot, Handsome Dan!",
          "links": []
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "For this game, we are using GameMaker Studio 2, which uses GML (GameMaker Language). We are using a hybrid of Photoshop and Pyxel Edit for all asset creation. We are still perfecting our version control protocols on our organizational Github!",
          "links": []
        }
      ],
      "links": []
    },
