    {
      "index": 24,
      "type": "text",
      "moduleId": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "caption",
          "text": "Assets from our new game, which is more sprite animation and UI heavy. I'm so excited for this new project!\nThe last image is a map created by our talented lead artist, Jack Li '23, and is based off of Yale's iconic old campus.",
          "links": []
        }
      ],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "type": "text",
      "moduleId": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "From a directing standpoint, I am continually amazed by the talent and creativity passing through this club. We are so lucky to have the support and interest from students as we do, and I look forward to what we can accomplish in the coming year!",
          "links": []
        }
      ],
      "links": []
    },
